# --- Source-tree hygiene (owner decision 2026-10-25) ---
# Prebuilt APK / APK-ZIP / idsig artifacts are DELIBERATELY NOT committed anymore:
# distribution runs exclusively via GitHub release assets (+ the LAN mirror).
# F-Droid rejects prebuilt binaries in the source tree, IzzyOnDroid takes the APKs
# from the releases. Do NOT `git add -f` them back — they stay untracked here.
*.apk
*.apk.zip
